-----------------------------------------------------------------------
MITRE ATLAS
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

data/atlas-ids.yaml (and its copy in plugin/skills/handrail-assessor/
data/) lists technique, tactic and mitigation identifiers
and names from MITRE ATLAS release 2026.09
(https://github.com/mitre-atlas/atlas-data), Copyright 2021-2026 MITRE,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
NIST
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

Subcategory identifiers from the NIST AI Risk Management Framework
(AI 100-1) and the Generative AI Profile (AI 600-1) are cited. NIST
publications are works of the United States Government.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Cited, not reproduced
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

These sources are cited by identifier only (and, where stated, a short
name). Their text is not included, and their own licences apply:

  - ISO/IEC 42001:2023 and ISO/IEC 42005:2025 (ISO and IEC, copyrighted):
    clause and control numbers with short titles.
  - CSA AI Controls Matrix (Cloud Security Alliance): bare control IDs.
  - CSA MAESTRO (Cloud Security Alliance): layer numbers and names.
  - AICPA Trust Services Criteria (SOC 2): bare criteria IDs.
  - OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications and Top 10 for Agentic Applications
    (OWASP Foundation): identifiers, with short names where shown.
  - Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 (EU AI Act): article numbers. Summaries are
    written for this project.

The worked examples describe fictional organizations. Any resemblance to a
real organization is unintended.
